---
import H1 from "../../components/h1.astro";
import InfoLayout from "../../layouts/InfoLayout.astro";
---

<InfoLayout title="About | Miles Sun" description="Product manager and AI builder based in Taipei.">
     <div class="p-4 sm:pt-8 sm:px-12 pb-20 min-h-dvh flex flex-col justify-between gap-32">
          <div class="space-y-8 sm:space-y-12">
               <H1> About </H1>

               <div class="space-y-6 text-base xl:text-xl text-zinc-500 leading-relaxed">
                    <p>
                         I am <span class="text-white">Miles (Sun, Mu Huan)</span>, a product manager with a background in AI engineering. I specialize in balancing technical feasibility, user needs, and business objectives—turning ideas into actionable roadmaps and driving projects from concept to reality.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                         From academic research to product practice, I have built cross-disciplinary projects across diverse domains: solo-developing iOS apps and AI automation tools, and contributing to product planning and industry research for EV charging platforms. During my master's studies, my research centered on generative AI and representation learning, which was presented orally at the ICAIIC 2026 international conference.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                         These experiences give me a rare blend of <span class="text-white">technical execution</span>, <span class="text-white">product intuition</span>, and <span class="text-white">project delivery</span>. When stepping into unfamiliar domains, I quickly establish sound judgment through systematic inquiry; when tackling complex problems, I assess technical feasibility, identify optimal AI use cases, and align stakeholders to deliver clear product strategy and execution.
                    </p>
               </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-2 text-base sm:text-lg">
               <h2 class="px-4 text-zinc-400 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-zinc-500">Experience</h2>
               <ul class="px-4 text-zinc-400 list-disc list-outside">
                    <li>Product Management Intern, DenDen</li>
                    <li>Project Management Intern, 5xRuby</li>
                    <li>Content Marketing Intern, Gogolook</li>
                    <li>Campus Ambassador, NISSAN</li>
                    <li>Campus Ambassador, MSI</li>
                    <li>Campus Ambassador, Intel</li>
                    <li>Campus Ambassador, Wreadit</li>
               </ul>
          </div>
     </div>
</InfoLayout>
